  <section class="section" id="journey">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">On board</p>
        <h2>Three reasons to leave the road behind.</h2>
        <p class="sub">
          Dune Line is one train, eleven carriages, and a route that has not changed since
          1974. Here is what the night buys you.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card reveal" style="--d:.02s">
          <span class="num" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
          <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M2.5 18.5v-6h15.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 3.5 3.5v2.5"/>
              <path d="M2.5 18.5h19"/>
              <path d="M6 12.5V9.2A1.7 1.7 0 0 1 7.7 7.5h3.1"/>
              <path d="M9.6 7.5v5"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>A door, a bed, a window</h3>
          <p>
            Every fare includes a real mattress behind a real door. Linen changed at
            Ashfall, a brass reading lamp, and glass cut wide enough for the dunes to
            go blue at two in the morning.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="card reveal" style="--d:.10s">
          <span class="num" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
          <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M20.4 14.6A8.2 8.2 0 1 1 9.5 3.7a6.6 6.6 0 0 0 10.9 10.9Z"/>
              <path d="M17.4 3.2v3.2M15.8 4.8h3.2"/>
              <path d="M21.2 8.6v2.2M20.1 9.7h2.2" opacity=".6"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Sky-deck lounge</h3>
          <p>
            The last carriage has almost no roof to speak of. Sit under the stars with a
            cardamom coffee and the wind off the sand until the city glow rises on the
            horizon.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="card reveal" style="--d:.18s">
          <span class="num" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
          <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="8" cy="8.5" r="4.2"/>
              <path d="M11.1 11.6 20 20.5"/>
              <path d="M16.8 17.3l1.8-1.8"/>
              <path d="M19.2 19.7l1.8-1.8"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Arrive rested, not wrecked</h3>
          <p>
            Breakfast is served ninety minutes out. Showers, pressed shirts and a porter
            who learns your name before Mirage Junction — so you walk into Vega Gate
            looking like you flew.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

